{"id":"189150f03c9cdc63","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-solovay-corollary.md","title":"Solovay Corollary","display":"cor-solovay-corollary — Solovay Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-solovay-corollary","aliases":["89-cor-solovay-corollary"],"display":"cor-solovay-corollary — Solovay Corollary","depends_on":["[[89-thm-solovay]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-solovay-corollary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-solovay-corollary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-solovay-corollary — Solovay Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a196c7fa2f0957d2\" href=\"?note=a196c7fa2f0957d2\" title=\"89-thm-solovay\">89-thm-solovay</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ce064881a79d6f7\" href=\"?note=0ce064881a79d6f7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-soundness\">89-df-arithmetical-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8f382173effd5662\" href=\"?note=8f382173effd5662\" title=\"89-df-pa-provable-formula\">89-df-pa-provable-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> is the PA realization set,\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> the PA-provable-sentence set, and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> standard-model soundness of PA.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}corollary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}corollary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 9 章，印刷页 124–130；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n此处按原书使用 PA 的标准模型可靠性。原文在证明新增根节点的极限句为真、反解释不可证时使用“PA 所证都真”；仅排除爆炸的一致性不能替代这一步的来源依据。该条件并未被宣称为所有理论推广或其他证明的最弱条件。完整方向来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b7050f6732cc53d7\" href=\"?note=b7050f6732cc53d7\" title=\"89-lem-solovay-lem2\">89-lem-solovay-lem2</a> 与 GL 的算术可靠性；本文件保留原有定理接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-solovay","status":"resolved","id":"a196c7fa2f0957d2","anchor":"